Subject: [PATCH] mpt3sas: Improvised loop logic
Date:   Fri, 20 Oct 2023 16:28:49 +0530
Message-Id: <20231020105849.6350-1-ranjan.kumar@broadcom.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.31.1
MIME-Version: 1.0
